 "summary": "ALGOL-based systems languages used to write the Burroughs B5000/B5500/B6500 MCP operating system: ESPOL extended ALGOL with hardware access, and NEWP replaced it for B6700-descended (Unisys MCP) systems with 'unsafe' code marking.",
